sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    rect rgb(224, 242, 254)
    note over: Cliente & Camada HTTP
    actor User as Usuário / Admin / Cliente
    participant Front as Navegador / HTTP Client
    participant Middleware as SessionMiddleware /  AdminSessionMiddleware
    end
    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
    note over: Serviço de Autenticação & Regra de Negócio
    participant AuthService as CustomerAuthService /  AdminAuthService
    participant BaseAuth as AbstractAuthService
    end
    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
    note over: Infraestrutura de Sessão & Armazenamento
    participant Redis as Predis\\Client (Redis 6379)
    participant PHPSession as PHP Session ($_SESSION local)
    participant DB as MySQL Database (tbkk_customer / tbkk_user)
    end
    note over: 1. Conexão e Autenticação via Redis (Modo Primário)
    User ->> Front : Submete formulário de Login (POST /account/login ou POST /admin/login)
    activate Front
    Front ->> Middleware : HTTP POST /login<br/>[email, password]
    activate Middleware
    Middleware ->> AuthService : authenticate(email, password)
    activate AuthService
    AuthService ->> DB : verifyCredentials(email, password)
    activate DB
    DB -->> AuthService : Credenciais Válidas (User DTO)
    deactivate DB
    AuthService ->> BaseAuth : createSession(userData)
    activate BaseAuth
    BaseAuth ->> Redis : new Predis\\Client()->connect()
    activate Redis
    Redis -->> BaseAuth : Conexão Estabelecida! ($useRedis = true)
    deactivate Redis
    BaseAuth ->> BaseAuth : Gera sessionId = bin2hex(random_bytes(32))
    BaseAuth ->> Redis : SET "sessao:cliente:{sessionId}" json_encode(userData)<br/>EXPIRE 7200s (2h)
    activate Redis
    Redis -->> BaseAuth : OK
    deactivate Redis
    BaseAuth -->> AuthService : Retorna sessionId
    deactivate BaseAuth
    AuthService -->> Middleware : AuthResult (Success, sessionId)
    deactivate AuthService
    Middleware ->> Front : Set-Cookie: session_id={sessionId}; Path=/; HttpOnly; Secure<br/>Redirect 302 /account/dashboard
    deactivate Middleware
    deactivate Front
    note over: 2. Detecção de Inacessibilidade do Redis & Fallback Gracioso
    User ->> Front : Tentativa de Login em ambiente onde o Redis está Offline / Inacessível
    activate Front
    Front ->> Middleware : HTTP POST /login<br/>[email, password]
    activate Middleware
    Middleware ->> AuthService : authenticate(email, password)
    activate AuthService
    AuthService ->> DB : verifyCredentials(email, password)
    activate DB
    DB -->> AuthService : Credenciais Válidas
    deactivate DB
    AuthService ->> BaseAuth : createSession(userData)
    activate BaseAuth
    BaseAuth ->> Redis : new Predis\\Client()->connect()
    activate Redis
    Redis --x BaseAuth : Connection Refused / Timeout Exception!
    deactivate Redis
    note over BaseAuth, PHPSession: **Mecanismo de Resiliência:**\nCaptura a exceção de conexão e define **$useRedis = false**.\nAlterna automaticamente e sem erros para a sessão nativa do PHP.
    BaseAuth ->> PHPSession : session_start()<br/>$_SESSION['logged_user'] = json_encode(userData)<br/>$_SESSION['expire'] = time() + 7200
    activate PHPSession
    PHPSession -->> BaseAuth : Sessão PHP Inicializada
    deactivate PHPSession
    BaseAuth -->> AuthService : Retorna PHP session_id()
    deactivate BaseAuth
    AuthService -->> Middleware : AuthResult (Success, sessionId)
    deactivate AuthService
    Middleware ->> Front : Set-Cookie: PHPSESSID={sessionId}<br/>Redirect 302 /account/dashboard
    deactivate Middleware
    deactivate Front
    note over: 3. Intercepção e Validação de Sessão por Middleware
    User ->> Front : Acessa rota protegida (ex: GET /account/orders ou GET /admin/dashboard)
    activate Front
    Front ->> Middleware : HTTP GET /account/orders<br/>[Cookie: session_id ou PHPSESSID]
    activate Middleware
    alt $useRedis == true
    Middleware ->> Redis : GET "sessao:cliente:{sessionId}"
    activate Redis
    alt Chave Existente no Redis
    Redis -->> Middleware : json_data (User DTO)
    Middleware ->> Middleware : Injecta 'logged_user' nas variáveis globais do Twig
    else Sessão Expirada / Removida
    Redis -->> Middleware : null
    Middleware -->> Front : HTTP 302 Redirect /account/login (Mensagem: Sessão Expirada)
    end
    deactivate Redis
    else Fallback Ativo ($useRedis == false)
    Middleware ->> PHPSession : session_start() & Read $_SESSION['logged_user']
    activate PHPSession
    PHPSession -->> Middleware : $_SESSION Data
    deactivate PHPSession
    end
    Middleware ->> Front : HTTP 200 OK (Renderiza View Solicitada)
    deactivate Middleware
    deactivate Front
